    "--- \n",
    "## Step 4: Tokenizer Construction (8,000 Vocab Production Model)\n",
    "\n",
    "Trains our primary **8,000 subword SentencePiece BPE tokenizer** (aligned with TA guidance for 25M parameter Transformer depth), plus an optional 32k model for ablation analysis."
   ]
